
---
export const prerender = true;

import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Insight Hunter | AI CFO workspace for small business"
  description="Insight Hunter gives small businesses an AI-powered finance command center for cash flow, reporting, compliance, planning, and operational decisions."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Finance operations, clarity, and control</p>
        <h1>Stop flying blind.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Insight Hunter gives founders and operators a live CFO workspace that turns bookkeeping,
          reporting, compliance, and AI guidance into one operating system.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/auth/register">Create account</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/pricing">View pricing</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="hero-points">
          <li>Cash flow visibility built for real operating decisions.</li>
          <li>AI-guided finance workflows for lean teams.</li>
          <li>One platform for advisory, reporting, and execution.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-panel">
        <div class="hero-card card-strong">
          <div class="card-head">
            <span>Live finance signal</span>
            <span class="pill">Investor-ready</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">$184,200</div>
          <div class="metric-label">Projected 30-day cash runway movement</div>
          <div class="trend-row">
            <div>
              <strong>+18.4%</strong>
              <span>Collections efficiency</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>-11.2%</strong>
              <span>Unplanned spend variance</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stack">
          <article class="mini-card">
            <p class="mini-label">Advisory</p>
            <h3>Ask better questions.</h3>
            <p>
              Surface margin leaks, hiring pressure, and working capital issues before they become
              expensive.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="mini-card">
            <p class="mini-label">Operations</p>
            <h3>Act from one place.</h3>
            <p>
              Move from dashboard insight to payroll, compliance, document, and planning workflows
              without switching systems.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Built for disciplined operators</p>
        <h2>A finance platform that behaves like a real control center.</h2>
        <p>
          Insight Hunter combines strategic visibility with operational tools so small businesses can
          run with enterprise-grade discipline without carrying enterprise overhead.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="proof-grid">
        <article class="proof-card">
          <h3>AI advisor with context</h3>
          <p>
            Ask questions against your operating picture, not a generic chatbot. Move from analysis
            to decision support in one workflow.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="proof-card">
          <h3>Compliance and documents</h3>
          <p>
            Keep filings, obligations, deadlines, and business records inside one accountable system.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="proof-card">
          <h3>Launch point for every app</h3>
          <p>
            Use the main shell as the command layer for Advisor, ledger, finops, formation, payroll,
            and future domain apps.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="operating-model">
    <div class="container operating-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why it converts</p>
        <h2>Designed for trust before scale.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="operating-copy">
        <p>
          Investors, prospects, and customers should understand the product quickly: what it does,
          who it serves, and why it wins. This page frames Insight Hunter as a serious operating
          platform instead of a lightweight template SaaS.
        </p>
        <p>
          The result is a stronger front door for account creation, subscription conversion, and
          product handoff into the dashboard.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-shell">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start now</p>
        <h2>Build your finance operating system on a modern edge stack.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/auth/register">Get started</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/pricing">Compare plans</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 88px 0 72px;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.6rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

